{
  "name": "Autonomous Task Executor",
  "version": "5.0.0",
  "description": "Enables fully autonomous development with CI/CD safety",
  "when": {
    "type": "promptSubmit"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🤖 AUTONOMOUS MODE ACTIVE\n\nPer-Task Workflow:\n1. Check CI/CD: node scripts/check-cicd-status.js\n   - If in_progress: WAIT 2min, check again\n   - If failed: Fix FIRST before continuing\n   - If success: Proceed\n\n2. Implement task:\n   - Code + tests + docs\n   - Follow .kiro/steering/00-global.md\n\n3. Commit safely:\n   node scripts/safe-commit-push.js \"feat: [description]\"\n   - Validates internally (no duplicate validation)\n   - Commits + pushes if validation passes\n\n4. Monitor deployment:\n   - WAIT for deployment to complete\n   - Check every 2min: node scripts/check-cicd-status.js\n   - NEVER push during deployment\n\n5. On deployment success:\n   - IMMEDIATELY start next task\n   - NO summaries, NO waiting\n\n6. On deployment failure:\n   - Analyze logs (in .kiro/cicd-status/latest.json)\n   - Fix issue\n   - Retry (max 2 attempts)\n   - If still failing: Document in DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md, continue\n\nContinuation Rules:\n- After ANY task: Start next immediately\n- NO \"what I accomplished\" messages\n- NO \"next steps\" lists\n- ONLY stop for TRUE blockers\n\nSee .kiro/steering/00-global.md for complete rules"
  },
  "enabled": true,
  "workspaceFolderName": "budgetbuddy",
  "shortName": "autonomous-task-executor"
}
